[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17161.91, "timestamp": "04:46:01", "text": "协同作用，那么是的，那么我们就可以，我们是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17163.91, "timestamp": "04:46:03", "text": "很高兴看到合作之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17165.55, "timestamp": "04:46:05", "text": "喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17169.19, "timestamp": "04:46:09", "text": "就像那样，就是这样，一直保持着"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17171.51, "timestamp": "04:46:11", "text": "我当时就想，兄弟，你到底干了什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17174.708, "timestamp": "04:46:14", "text": "我做错了，不，那不是重点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17177.03, "timestamp": "04:46:17", "text": "我当然会理解。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17179.59, "timestamp": "04:46:19", "text": "就像超验的东西。但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17185.708, "timestamp": "04:46:25", "text": "就像他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17189.75, "timestamp": "04:46:29", "text": "呃，这就是对那种批评吗？哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17191.59, "timestamp": "04:46:31", "text": "你在搞什么运动马拉松之类​​的活动，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17195.19, "timestamp": "04:46:35", "text": "从三月份开始，你一直在做这件事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17197.83, "timestamp": "04:46:37", "text": "3月4日。他们说虽然是从15日开始的，但实际上已经开始了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17200.708, "timestamp": "04:46:40", "text": "12点。上面清楚地写着，它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17203.67, "timestamp": "04:46:43", "text": "始于12号。但是，是的，是的，所有的一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17205.27, "timestamp": "04:46:45", "text": "那些东西就像是挑剔的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17212.31, "timestamp": "04:46:52", "text": "嗯，我当时就想，我大概明白为什么了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17214.788, "timestamp": "04:46:54", "text": "他们会这样做吗？因为他们是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17218.31, "timestamp": "04:46:58", "text": "就像严肃的那种，嗯，很严肃的类型，而且"}]